    65	## 2. Verdicts
    66	
    67	* **Law (i) `td <= m·n`: UNFALSIFIED.** It holds on the one realized
    68	  record (residue-A, **at equality** `6 = 2·3`, with
    69	  `I_∞ = 168·252 − 6 = 42330` — 99.986% of the Bézout budget at
    70	  infinity) and FAILS on 22 of 23 filed off-axis entries — **which
    71	  is exactly the kill record**: every configuration the campaign's
    72	  books have adjudicated dead (td-7's 17 cells, td-11's 411 rows,
    73	  td-13's entry rows) violates the law. The law would retroactively
    74	  EXPLAIN every kill the books produced by chart-tower labor.
    75	* **Law (ii) `td | mn·Πq_h`** (with `q_h := (b_i)`, the MP4 edge
    76	  powers — the available Cor-7.4-power reading at the entry tier):
    77	  coarser — it admits the killed-expected td-8 `[2,2]` entry; law
