    81	  below the bound besides residue-A: the td-12 type-(3,5) entry —
    82	  the single configuration in the entire filed range whose book was
    83	  never built.** The candidate law refuses to kill precisely the
    84	  one object nobody has adjudicated. Types occurring in the filed
    85	  range are `{(2,3),(2,5),(3,4),(3,5)}` with `max mn = 15`, so the
    86	  law caps the whole filed ladder at `td <= 15`.
