    88	## 3. CONJECTURE TD-BOUND
    89	
    90	*For every dominant GGV-standard `(m,n)`-pair (Keller candidate in
    91	rectangular normal form), the topological degree satisfies*
    92	
    93	```text
    94	        td  <=  m · n,
    95	```
    96	
    97	*with the sharper frontier form `td = m·n` suggested by the realized
    98	record. Combined with Żoładek's `td >= 6` and the finiteness of the
    99	GGV `(m,n)`-list, this makes the sheet ladder FINITE (REDUCTION gap
   100	G5): only types with `mn >= 6` and rungs `6 <= td <= mn` survive —
   101	in the filed range, residue-A `(2,3)@6` and the td-12 `(3,5)` entry
   102	(plus the not-yet-filed `(3,5)` rungs `td <= 15` and `(3,4)` rung
   103	`td = 12`).*
   104	
   105	## 4. What a proof needs (the I_∞ accounting)
   106	
   107	Bézout is the identity `td = deg f·deg g − I_∞`. The conjecture is
   108	equivalent to `I_∞ >= deg f·deg g − mn = (B²−1)mn` at scale
   109	`B = gcd(deg f, deg g)` — i.e., the certified edge-power contact
   110	(Cor. 7.4: every edge is a power `λR^{qm}`) must consume all but an
   111	`(m,n)`-shaped remainder of the budget. The promoted chart machinery
   112	is the natural accountant: the campaign's `D_f/deg_p_f` ledgers ARE
   113	contact-order data (the trunk certificate's global degrees
   114	`2374050 : 3561075 = 2 : 3` carry the full infinity tower for the
   115	td-7 kill), and the tower calculus already computes per-vertex
   116	contact multiplicities exactly. The missing step is a lemma summing
   117	those per-chart contacts to `I_∞` for an ARBITRARY admissible
   118	configuration — the same L1–L9 frame data, read as intersection
   119	multiplicities at the line at infinity. Grok's mixed-volume/BKK
   120	route (`lib/families.py` supports, `case_rows(150)`) is the
   121	independent cross-check track.
   122	
   123	## 5. What this predicts, checkably
   124	
   125	1. The unbuilt books (td 8, 10, 12-(2,3)/(2,5), 14) will all close —
   126	   they violate the law.
   127	2. The td-12 `(3,5)` entry is the next genuine frontier object and
   128	   should RESIST the cheap instruments the way residue-A does.
   129	3. Any future book kill of a `td <= mn` configuration other than by
   130	   realization-tier arithmetic would FALSIFY the frontier form
   131	   `td = mn`; a realized configuration with `td > mn` falsifies the
   132	   conjecture outright — either would be a named major result.
