   253	3. **If td is PRIME, every single-pole configuration is excluded**: the
   254	   Lambda = td leaf table is exactly {(alpha,td) : alpha | td-1,
   255	   nu = alpha, a = b = 1}, all with b = 1. (§2 proof; mechanically
   256	   re-verified for the 11 primes <= 40.)
   257	4. [+H5a] gcd(a, nu) = 1.
   258	
   259	**Theorem TDU-neg (non-generalization).** The promoted kill set (pin +
   260	N1 + AF2-derived pricing incl. IIb + E5-III + St 9.4/9.5 budgets + H3q

