   689	its G2 diagnosis is the gap repaired here.  The pre-Laurent/post-Laurent
   690	type boundary is recorded in
   691	[SECTION4-AUTOMATION.md](SECTION4-AUTOMATION.md).
   692	
   693	## 8. Remaining unproved statements
   694	
   695	Everything below is explicitly unproved.
   696	
   697	**CONJECTURE T (corner-to-tree functor).**  A fiber-tagged, paired
   698	Newton–Puiseux construction may carry the complete GGV chain to the full
   699	decorated Sigray Eggers–Wall pole tree.  The present theorem does not do so;
   700	the GGV \(P\)-polygon alone does not determine residual \(Q\)-cancellation or
   701	pole status.
   702	
   703	**CONJECTURE A (native transposed admissibility).**  After changing from the
   704	x-fraction Laurent convention to the transposed y-fraction convention, all
   705	fourteen GGV5 complete-chain conditions should admit a convention-by-convention
   706	transposed formulation.  Only the exact rational valuation ledger and its
   707	inverse are proved here; native re-certification is not needed for (6.1).
   708	
   709	No conjecture identifying residue-A or the td-7 formal record with the
   710	`(8,28)` representative is viable under the normalized degree data: the
   711	machine gate proves those frames are different.

