   888	
   889	The implemented on-axis sweep is exactly \(6\le d\le14\). The off-axis
   890	entry census discussed in the book files is also bounded. No cited GGV result
   891	or sheet theorem supplies an upper bound on \(d\). The GGV22 “\(\ge125\) or
   892	\((72,108)\)” result is a lower-bound dichotomy in polynomial degree and says
   893	nothing that truncates topological degree.
