   254	solvable M = 2 cells (nu odd, l = 2) are not reachable by any in-caps
   255	chain pair. So L1 HOLDS on the zero-chain family for everything
   256	reachable — but by reach + suffix + coefficients, NOT by a printed
   257	statement (the blind spot of §3 applies here too).
